.cxx/

# The repo root ignores *.keystore, which is right for real signing keys.
# React Native's debug.keystore is different: it is a publicly known key that
# ships in every RN template, it only signs debug builds, and without it in
# the repo `pnpm android` fails for anyone else who clones. So it is
# re-included here, deliberately and narrowly.
!apps/mobile/android/app/debug.keystore
